      "text": "```\n  NOT: visiting a community for a few days and interviewing people\n  NOT: distributing surveys to community members\n  NOT: reading documents about a community\n  NOT: observing from a distance as a neutral observer"
    },
    {
      "id": "05-CULTURAL-ANTHROPOLOGY.md#008",
      "path": [
        "05-CULTURAL-ANTHROPOLOGY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
