        "root_concepts": "[cultural, anthropology]",
        "section": "anthropology",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Cultural Anthropology",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "IS:\n  ┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n  │ 1. Prolonged engagement (typically 12+ months)         │\n  │    Living in the community, not visiting it            │\n  │                                                        │\n  │ 2. Language competence                                 │\n  │    Not through interpreters; direct access to          │\n  │    ordinary speech, jokes, arguments, casual talk      │\n  │                                                        │\n  │ 3. Participation                                       │\n  │    Actually doing the activities: fishing, farming,    │\n  │    ritual performance, market trading                  │\n  │    Competence cannot be faked; doing reveals things    │\n  │    that watching does not                              │\n  │                                                        │\n  │ 4. Systematic fieldnotes                               │\n  │    Written the same day or night. Detailed. Observable │\n  │    behavior + context + interpretation separately      │\n  │    marked. Sensory details. Quotes verbatim.           │\n  │                                                        │\n  │ 5. Multiple methods layered                            │\n  │    Observation + interview + genealogy + mapping +     │\n  │    artifact collection + life histories                │\n  └────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘"
    }
